"P2082253692" "So, the Rikti eliminated the gods on their own planet? How very strange. That could explain their extreme hatred of heroes as well; after all, many of you seem like gods to the people you protect."
// RandomFameString :
"P641567059" "The Rikti and the Circle of Thorns are no match for {HeroName}!"

