// Objective - HostageWithClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P129457390" "I've got to tell you what's going on here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1902713838" "You defeated the Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1548176418" "Yeah, I've heard of the Brotherhood. It's a group composed mostly of lost souls: the confused, the lonely, those who are looking for someone in the world to connect to. Can you believe they even think the Rikti are related to human beings? You did good work rescuing those people, {HeroName}. They may feel adrift now, but at least they have a chance at a life without illusions."
// RandomFameString :
"P4017133149" "The Rikti laid a trap, but {HeroName} was too foxy for them!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Rikti_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CDs 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2315555331" "Rikti CD's"
// DetailString :
"P876468821" "The CD's you confiscated are a mix of Rikti music, dance beats, and human vocals. The crates in which they were stored were labeled 'Pacify,' 'Stupefy,' 'Euphoria,' 'Terror,' and 'Enrage.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1129353077" "You know those recordings the Rikti POW's made of the music piped into their cells? Well, the government's afraid that music may contain subversive propaganda, and they're fighting an uphill battle to keep it out of people's hands. I've got a lead on a warehouse that's storing a bunch of CD's: Rikti music mixed with dance tracks, that sort of thing. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to confiscate that Rikti music and defeat the Rikti doing the distribution.</A> You'll have to hurry; once those discs hit the streets, there's no getting them back. You only have 1 hour to stop the distribution."
// AcceptString :
"P2219115264" "Confiscate the Rikti music"
// SendOffString :
"P1080873863" "It's strange to protect people from something that seems so innocuous. Thanks for trusting me on this one."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2144482947" "Confiscate CD's & defeat Rikti"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3215775132" "Those Rikti CD's could hit the streets any minute. Someone's got to confiscate them before it's too late!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P545913775" "You hear music, strange, but not unpleasant. Suddenly the weight of the world seems lighter, and you march into the warehouse with your head held high."

