// Dialog :
"P473775149" "You failed to prevent all the CD's from making it to the streets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3430470498" "This Rikti music is more insidious than anybody could have guessed. It's not propaganda; it's outright mind control! Those CD's labeled 'Euphoria' actually make you feel happy! Ditto for the rest. By conditioning people to accept emotional cues from this music, the Rikti can steal into our very minds. Who knows what they could make people do?"
// RandomFameString :
"P4191029068" "I was going to buy a Rikti music bootleg, but {HeroName} shut that business down."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1319269571" "A few CD's made it to the streets, but at least we know a lot more about them now. The crates they were in were labeled 'Pacify,' 'Stupefy,' 'Euphoria,' 'Terror,' and 'Enrage.' And, {HeroName}, that's just what they do! The CD's labeled 'Euphoria' actually make you feel happy. Ditto for the rest. We'll have to keep a tight lock on this business from now on; otherwise, we'll be giving the Rikti a window into our very hearts!"
// RandomFameString :
"P379786554" "Want to hear my new Rikti CD? I swear, it makes me feel on top of the world!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Rikti_Compound1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DocStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P712917155" "The doctor's story"
// DetailString :
"P3806068495" "One of the doctors you rescued told you:<br><br>'You'll never guess why they wanted us. The Rikti have the chicken pox! I know we think of it as a simple childhood virus, but their reaction to it is far more severe. It's killing them! They kidnapped some of my colleagues as well, but they must have taken them to another facility. I hope you'll help them, but please be careful! The Rikti were very hostile to us; I think they may view this disease as a type of biological warfare.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Cure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2207636026" "Medical kit"
// DetailString :
"P1042694599" "Though there is no known cure for chicken pox, this medical kit contains several doses of an anti-viral medication that should help the Rikti fight off the infection. It also contains several doses of a vaccine, to be used by uninfected Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Babies 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3734408067" "The Rikti progeny"
// DetailString :
"P2740206413" "One of the doctors you rescued told you:<br><br>'I know why they're so desperate for this cure. They don't want it just for their soldiers; they want it for their children. That's right, children! They wouldn't permit me to see them first hand, but there are whole nurseries filled with infant Rikti in other well-hidden bases. I think they're rebuilding their whole civilization, right here on Earth.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1385976774" "The Rikti just attacked Chiron Medical Center! <br><br>Every single doctor was kidnapped, though the Rikti didn't seem to be interested in the nursing staff or orderlies. In fact, they left everyone else  strictly alone. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to rescue those doctors from the Rikti, {HeroName}.</A> If they need human doctors, it could mean they're cooking up some new biological weapon. <br><br>As soon as you're out of there, I want you to talk to <color deepskyblue>Professor Jonathan St. John-Smythe</color> about possible threats posed by a biological attack."
// AcceptString :
"P2093902475" "Rescue the doctors from the Rikti"
// SendOffString :
"P2623090510" "See if you can find out what the Rikti are planning. Whatever it is, I'm sure it's not good."

