"P579457381" "Dr. Laura H. Powell"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2064455345" "You saved me! They would have kept me here forever!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Mission2HostageWithClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1763946318" "Dr. Howard Reyes"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2856005501" "I have something to tell you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P733358568" "You defeated the Rikti and rescued the doctors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1633552582" "The Rikti are having children, in their military outposts? I know they're an alien civilization, but it still doesn't make sense. <br><br>I've got a theory about this, {HeroName}. We know that we've been unable to access the Rikti world since the war. What if the Rikti can't either? They're rebuilding their civilization, because their old world is lost to them. <br><br>I'd bet my life on it."
// RandomFameString :
"P3000669871" "{HeroName} saved my doctor from the Rikti, just in time for my annual checkup!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Rikti_Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_BUSINESS 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_CASUAL 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HostageStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P1045763656" "One of the hostages you rescued told you:<br><br>'The Rikti tried to force us to eat this weird, green fluid. But then some other Rikti came along and stopped them!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GreenGoo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1652511887" "Strange fluid"
// DetailString :
"P320314512" "You found this canister of fluid at the site of the Rikti assault. The design of the canister is similar to those used to transport the mutagenic goo the Rikti use to turn the Lost into monsters. However, the color of this fluid is different, and the canister is missing the large orange designs that Rikti linguists assume are warnings of hazardous contents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RiktiStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2850524405" "The Rikti's story"
// DetailString :
"P3650743787" "One of the Rikti you defeated gasped in a hoarse and struggling accent:<br><br>'I'll tell you what you want to know. Why should I keep silent? The Traditionalist plan is an abomination! They think waste like you can become part of the great Rikti legacy. It is a thought not to be uttered without laughter. You should hurry, little hero. By now, their plan is nearing its completion.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1851841026" "The Rikti are planning a major assault on Founders' Falls! We haven't faced a situation like this since the war, when they wiped out whole cities. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to get over there and stop  this Rikti assault, {HeroName}.</A> I can give you the location of their first strike; it's the Sanderson office complex. After that, you'll have to figure out their next strike site for yourself. Watch out though, you probably won't have a lot of time to stop that second strike."
// AcceptString :
"P2271577790" "Stop the Rikti assault"
// SendOffString :
"P2153267793" "It's been a long time since we've seen violence like this. Anything you can learn about their motives will help."

