// ModelDisplayName :
"P773018962" "Warehouse worker"
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P2824516651" "They tired to make us drink this green goo!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P142840249" "You stopped the Rikti plan to alter the human population in Founders' Falls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3585907249" "You failed to stop the Rikti before they altered some people."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1735367654" "It looks like the factions within the Rikti army may be fighting a war as desperate as their war with humanity. I can't thank you enough for stopping the Traditionalist plot, {HeroName}. It's hard to imagine the terror that would have swept through the populace if the Rikti had altered those people!"
// RandomFameString :
"P4054105113" "Did you see {HeroName} on the news?  Now, that's a hero who can show the Rikti who's boss!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3484739521" "It looks like the factions within the Rikti army may be fighting a war as desperate as their war with humanity. We'll try to recover the people the Rikti altered. Maybe, just maybe, our scientists can do something to help them."
// RandomFameString :
"P351628537" "{HeroName} tried to stop the Rikti, but they mutated a bunch of people in my neighborhood!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Rikti_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2045129846" "Since people learned the Rikti can impersonate humans, we've been seeing a lot of paranoia. People don't trust each other. There's even a very real threat of civilian violence! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over to the Crey's Folly and defeat as many Rikti as you can.</A> If people can see that we're on top of the Rikti situation, they'll feel a lot more secure."
// AcceptString :
"P3019893721" "Go to the Crey's Folly and defeat as many Rikti as you can"
// SendOffString :
"P231355346" "When people get scared, they do irrational things. Sometimes it's our job to protect them from their own worst impulses."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1896377901" "Defeat Rikti Crey's Folly"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1183041315" "I think a bigger demonstration is in order. I need you to defeat some more Rikti, really make people feel safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3833744314" "You defeated enough Rikti to calm the fears of the civilian paranoia."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3386906975" "I just got a call from the Paragon City Free Press; they had a photographer covering your sweep through Crey's Folly. They wanted a quote about it all. I told them that as long as {HeroName} is on the job, the Rikti will never threaten our safety again. People in this town respect you, {HeroName}. Your actions have a lot of impact."
// RandomFameString :
"P2956600252" "I saw {HeroName} kicking some Rikti tail earlier. I got to tell you, it makes me feel safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Rikti_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3813301242" "For the last few days the Rikti have been all over the factories over in Crey's Folly. They're making off with the companies' technology, even carrying off an occasional technician who gets in their way. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to head over to Crey's Folly and clear the Rikti out.</A> We can't let them get their hands on any more technology!"
// AcceptString :
"P975227602" "Go to Crey's Folly and clear the Rikti out"
// SendOffString :
"P4190155764" "The more technology the Rikti acquire, the greater the chance they'll find a way to teleport through our city zone force fields."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2672744370" "Protect Crey's Folly from Rikti"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2966126158" "The Rikti are still a threat to Crey's Folly. Somebody has to get them out of that zone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P305668338" "You discouraged the Rikti from pilfering technology in Crey's Folly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1428510950" "Well, the Rikti will think twice before they hit the factories in Crey's Folly again! You did a great job, {HeroName}. I'm sure those technicians are grateful."
// RandomFameString :
"P4220510947" "I used to be scared to go to work, but now {HeroName}'s keeping the Rikti away from the lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Rikti_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P781939939" "Even after the war's end, the Rikti trapped on Earth still pose a deadly threat to the whole of mankind. We still don't know what they want or why they attacked in the first place, only that they refuse to give up and continue to spread panic and fear in the people of the city and the world. You're a well respected hero, {HeroName}, and I think, if you were to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>concentrate your efforts against the Rikti </A>for a while, it could help to show that the world's greatest heroes can defend the people of Earth."
// AcceptString :
"P3308325422" "Concentrate your efforts against the Rikti menace."
// SendOffString :
"P491535760" "The people of the city will be watching you closely, {HeroName}, hoping to get inspiration from each victory you have against the Rikti."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P753528606" "Combat Rikti menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P736716965" "Every Rikti trooper or drone you defeat helps the people of the city believe that the nightmare of the Rikti War is closer to an end."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2618238099" "You have defeated enough Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2063599276" "The menace of the Rikti is far from over, but you've shown people that they can't let fear of the invaders rule their lives. The Rikti are still a threat, but with heroes like you in the world, I think it's a threat that we can handle."
// RandomFameString :
"P1520668851" "I saw {HeroName} letting loose on the Rikti earlier."

